license: Apache-2.0

website: https://github.com/SomeBlackMagic/salt-incus-ext
source: https://github.com/SomeBlackMagic/salt-incus-ext
issues: https://github.com/SomeBlackMagic/salt-incus-ext/issues

summary: |
  Provides custom Salt modules for managing Incus:

  Execution modules:
    - incus_mod            — core Incus operations
    - incus_instance_mod   — instance lifecycle management
    - incus_network_mod    — network configuration
    - incus_storage_pool_mod — storage pool management
    - incus_volume_mod     — volume management
    - incus_profile_mod    — profile management
    - incus_trust_mod      — trust/certificate management
    - incus_cluster_mod    — cluster operations
    - incus_image_mod      — image management
    - incus_pki_mod        — PKI/certificate generation
    - incus_settings_mod   — Incus server settings

  State modules:
    - incus_instance_mod          — instance state management
    - incus_instance_snapshot_mod — instance snapshot management
    - incus_network_mod           — network state management
    - incus_storage_pool_mod      — storage pool state management
    - incus_volume_mod            — volume state management
    - incus_profile_mod           — profile state management
    - incus_trust_mod             — trust state management
    - incus_cluster_mod           — cluster state management
    - incus_image_mod             — image state management
    - incus_pki_mod               — PKI state management
    - incus_settings_mod          — settings state management

  Cloud modules:
    - incus_mod — Incus cloud driver for Salt Cloud
